title: GET /repos/:repo/log/contexts
tags: [[HTTP endpoint]] [[Event log]]
kind: reference
audience: dev
summary: Label summaries, newest first, without reading an operation: counts, first and last operation, what each reverts and is reverted by.

Query: `parent` (`none`, the default, for the units of work; a label id for the labels
nested in it), `before` (a label id: only older ones), `limit` (50 by default, 500 at
most). Answer: `head`, `head_log_context`, `labels`, `next_before` (the `before` of the next
page, `null` on the last) and `total_log_contexts`. What a summary holds, and how the marks
are worked out: [[Log context summaries]].
